📊 Retail Sales Performance Dashboard

Tools Used: MySQL | Power BI

🔍 Project Overview

This project analyzes retail sales data using SQL for data processing and Power BI for visualization. The goal was to generate business KPIs, identify trends, and build an executive-level dashboard.

🛠 Steps Performed

Imported sales data into MySQL

Performed KPI calculations using SQL

Analyzed:

Total Sales

Total Profit

Profit Margin

Monthly Sales Trend

Sales by Region

Sales by Category

Top 10 Customers

Connected MySQL to Power BI

Built interactive dashboard with KPI cards and charts

📈 Key Insights

Total Sales reached 12.59M with 1.10M profit

South region contributes highest revenue

Technology is the top-performing category

Sales peak observed in January

Top customers contribute significant revenue (Pareto trend)





🎯 Business Value

This dashboard helps stakeholders:

Monitor revenue & profitability

Identify high-performing regions

Track monthly sales trends

Understand customer contribution
